  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> 5th-level arcanopulser, Pulse shield class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> You can transfuse power spent elsewhere in order to fuel your magical wrath. Whenever you spend a spell point for any reason, you can also conjure a pulse shield without spending its spell point cost. Whenever you cast a sphere effect using at least a move action, you may spend 1 additional spell point to empower your pulse shots as normal.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/arcanopulser#toc21\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
